    "en": "Rare Glyph \nTactician\nRadius Size: 3 \nGrants +25.0% bonus to all Rare nodes within range.\nAdditional Bonus: \nYou deal 15% [x] increased damage for 4 seconds after casting a Defensive Skill. This duration is increased by 4 seconds for each Defensive Skill not on your Action Bar.\nRequired (purchased in range): +25 Dexterity\nLegendary Bonus: \nIncrease damage by 0.5% [x] . \nRequired: Legendary Upgrade (unlocks at Level 50)",
